     out of the `2N`-dimensional Majorana subspace `span_ℂ {W Γ_b W*}`.
2. **Universal all-`r` exact-span Krylov barrier vs. return-excised super-matchgate onset:**
   - `no_subexponential_exactSpan_replicaGram_above_half`: for every `N ≥ 2`, `(N + 1) / 2 ≤ s`,
     `r ≥ 1`, `M ≥ 1`, and `t : Fin M → [0, T]` with `‖H.val‖ * T + 1 ≤ 4 ^ N / 2800`,
     `(199 / 200) ^ (2 * r) ≤ (Module.finrank ℂ (replicaTargetSpan r target) : ℝ) *
       empiricalReplicaBessel H r t` (blocking every sub-exponential-horizon `r`-replica Gram bound
     even using the exact `replicaTargetSpan` dimension and even on `Ω_rk3(n, η)`).
   - `tenthPlateauOnset_lt_of_superMatchgate_returnExcised`: return-excised multi-date replica Gram
